                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "# Loaded Skill: lore-self-household-index (skill)\n\nKai's money, the people she lives with, and the locked household plan, seven entries covering the parsed financial baseline, the ADU contract, the named housemates, and the plan's settings, inputs and findings. Each body is a file in references/. Triggers - who lives with Kai, housemates, roommates, who is the partner, who is the metamour, partner's name, metamour's name, Elizabeth, Elizabeth Posadas, elizposadas, Kat, zkat, is this a group event, who is on this invite, three people on the invite, calendar invite FYI, did Kai attend or speak, ADU, Via Acalanes, Atlantis Remodeling, construction pause, funding gap, savings rate, when can I afford it, permit, stucco, draw the loan, tax return, 1040, paystub, withholding, refund, net pay, 401k, take-home, spend baseline, run rate, how much does Kai make, effective tax rate, CA SDI, sharing versus separate, two ledgers, metamour exit age, leaves at 45, break-even rate, $137/hr, who pays for which child, access beats wealth, who does the plan fail, what did the plan establish, household spend, non-Kai spend, solvency cliff, headroom, university cost, college funding, when does the plan fail, contracting rate, homestead workbook, plan-params, is the plan safe, $200k lock, $250k, salary lock, household total, 2533k, 4376k, per-ledger split, what did the salary change cost, superseded run, re-lock the plan, household plan, family finances, homestead, partner work, metamour retirement, Foxtrot, Zulu, trust for partner, shared money, independent share, when can she stop working.\n\n## Content\n\n# self-household index\n\n7 entries. Each one is a file under `references/`, read the one you need\nrather than the whole directory.\n\n* [`adu-financing.md`](references/adu-financing.md) - The 574 Via Acalanes ADU\n  - contract terms, payment milestones, the funding gap, and the settled\n  analysis of pausing versus delaying.\n* [`financial-baseline.md`](references/financial-baseline.md) - Kai's parsed\n  source financial numbers - 2025 return, current paystub, Lunch Money run-\n  rate, and the two findings they establish.\n* [`housemates.md`](references/housemates.md) - The two adults who live with\n  Kai, named and mapped to the partner and metamour roles the plan models, and\n  the rule that their presence on a calendar invitation is an FYI rather than a\n  signal about the event.\n* [`homestead-findings.md`](references/homestead-findings.md) - The findings\n  the household plan established and the terms it leaves unmodelled - sharing\n  versus separate ledgers, the metamour's exit age, the break-even rate, and\n  who every failure lands on.\n* [`homestead-inputs.md`](references/homestead-inputs.md) - The inputs Kai has\n  supplied to the household plan, the solvency cliff and headroom they imply,\n  the findings that survived, and the two instruments that compute them.\n* [`homestead-salary-lock.md`](references/homestead-salary-lock.md) - What\n  locking Kai's employed salary at $200k did to the household plan, the\n  superseded $250k run kept as its derivation, and the per-ledger figure that\n  must not be quoted.\n* [`homestead-threshold.md`](references/homestead-threshold.md) - The locked\n  2026-2082 household plan - who is in it, the fixed settings, and the income\n  and commitments those settings fully determine.\n\n## Supporting Files\n\nSkill directory: /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index\n\nRelative paths in this skill resolve from the skill directory. The shell tool runs in the session working directory, so use the resolved path below or `cd` into the skill directory before running supporting scripts.\n\n- references/housemates.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/housemates.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/housemates.md\"))\n- references/homestead-threshold-plan-params.json → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-threshold-plan-params.json (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-threshold-plan-params.json\"))\n- references/homestead-salary-lock.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-salary-lock.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-salary-lock.md\"))\n- references/homestead-findings.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-findings.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-findings.md\"))\n- references/adu-financing.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/adu-financing.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/adu-financing.md\"))\n- references/financial-baseline.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/financial-baseline.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/financial-baseline.md\"))\n- references/homestead-threshold-cassandra-briefing-2026-09-13.txt → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-threshold-cassandra-briefing-2026-09-13.txt (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-threshold-cassandra-briefing-2026-09-13.txt\"))\n- references/homestead-inputs.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-inputs.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-inputs.md\"))\n- references/homestead-threshold.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-threshold.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-threshold.md\"))\n- references/homestead-threshold-household-fte-plan.html → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-threshold-household-fte-plan.html (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-threshold-household-fte-plan.html\"))\n- references/homestead-threshold-household-fte-plan.xlsx → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-1/.agents/skills/lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-threshold-household-fte-plan.xlsx (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-household-index/references/homestead-threshold-household-fte-plan.xlsx\"))\n"
